  "releaseNotes": "v4.3.3 perf(cloudsync): span-based tokenising and phrase lookup for the path signals (#1889)\n        v0.7.1 fix(cloudsync): classification wiring review leftovers (#1856)\n        v0.7.0 feat(cloudsync): log files roll at 10 MB, keep 7 days and 100 MB in total (slice 5 of #1411)\n        v0.6.0 feat(cloudsync): account hash in log lines and a reader for the local log files (slice 4 of #1411)\n        v0.5.0 feat(cloudsync): per-account verbose log level and filter (slice 2 of #1411)\n        v0.4.2 refactor(logging): drop InternalsVisibleTo from LoggingExtensions (#1417)\n        v0.4.1 chore(logging)!: make LoggerMessage placeholder names PascalCase (#1375)\n        v0.4.0 feat(logging): export error.type on failed operations (#1374)\n        v0.3.1 fix(logging)!: hash paths and account ids, drop URLs and users from log attributes (#1376)\n        v0.3.0 feat(logging)!: complete the OTel resource (service.version, instance id, deployment environment) (#1370)\n        v0.2.3 fix(logging)!: log exception type names only, remove exception-taking templates (#1371)\n        v0.2.2 fix(logging)!: log exception type names only, remove exception-taking templates (#1371)\n        v0.2.1 fix(logging): log page views as PageView and 500 errors with EventId 500 (#1377)\n        v0.2.0 feat: key-point logging and a local log file\n        v0.1.2 chore: enforce code style in build repo-wide\n        v0.1.1 chore: solution cleanup - namespaces, XML doc formatting, test folder alignment",
